  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCInteractable
  dialogueLines:
  - 'I can''t believe they destroyed this village cat!

    Press Q to continue.'
  - 'The tyrannical kingdom has been pillaging everything. '
  - 'I don''t know what they''re after for, but I think a smart kitty like you has to do it with it. '
  - I sensed the wizards magic when you teleported here...
  - 'Seems that coward abandoned us. Don''t fret I''ll take you to their camp for revenge! '
